From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:52:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 122/151] Status bar: cursor, selection, counts and file labels

Data and text for an optional status bar, without the widget yet: cursor
line and column, selection and column block size, line, character and word
counts with a cache keyed on a change generation, and the line ending,
encoding and indentation labels. Word counting stops above 2 MB of text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

